[i]Hello, children of the night[/i]🩸[i]![/i]
Updated the demo not too long ago. Now you can play [b]The Hungry Town[/b] in Chinese and Japanese languages. I also worked on the save system, now you can save at any time. 
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44305075/1fdf4eca24c629882ca21fdf9e8d6e316cce8265.png[/img]
[b]Full list of updates DEMO V.1D:[/b]
[list]
[*] Ability to save from the game menu at any time;
[*] Flexible sound and text settings: adjust the speed of dialogs, music volume and voiceovers;
[*] Improved character movement animation: simulated walking instead of just moving sprites;
[*] Updated interface of dialogs and in-game smartphone, which became more intuitive and functional;
[*] Added support for Chinese and Japanese languages;
[*] Improved backgrounds of city locations;
[*] Fixed minor bugs for more comfortable passing.
[/list]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44305075/c6f0abf22908b2cc5127c682cab8d29fd2d5c7e9.jpg[/img]
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44305075/1fdf4eca24c629882ca21fdf9e8d6e316cce8265.png[/img]

Try out the new demo: [url=https://store.steampowered.com/app/3276460/The_Hungry_Town_Demo/][b]PLAY![/b][/url]

And add [b]The Hungry Town[/b] to your wishlist:

https://store.steampowered.com/app/2481160/
Alexey Osh from [b]Kick Punch Games[/b] 😎

Although this festival is more for release games and discounts, and also you can participate with a demo or just a page.  

[i]For [b]Steam Scream[/b], I have prepared a new version of The Hungry Town demo, in which I fixed some bugs and finalized various details.[/i].

[b]What exactly added and fixed⚙️:[/b]
[list]
[*] Refined a few artefacts;
[*] Fixed inconsistencies in the text;
[*] Removed errors in English localization;
[*] Added volume settings, separately for music and dialog;
[*] Added text speed setting;
[*] Fixed a couple of bugs. [i]One critical one that broke saves, but it seemed to get only me[/i]🤫.
[/list]

https://store.steampowered.com/app/3276460/The_Hungry_Town_Demo/
